A series of '''dry lands''' existed on an [[Unidentified barren moon|unnamed moon]]. Terrain on the rocky,<ref name="Sideshow" /> barren [[moon]],<ref name="Insider">{{InsiderCite|214|Decoding Darth Vader}}</ref> the dry lands sat beside a [[labyrinth of rock pinnacles]]. When the [[Sith Lord]] [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] followed his former master, [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]], to the moon,<ref name="Part VI">{{Kenobi|Part VI}}</ref> Vader chased Kenobi above the dry lands<ref name="Sideshow" /> and landed there, where he began the [[Fight on a barren moon|lightsaber duel]] that moved into the nearby labyrinth.<ref name="Part VI" />

